---
title: CLI
description: Install items from this registry with the shadcn-svelte CLI.
order: 4
---

Any item can be installed directly into another project, without cloning this repo:

```bash
bunx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

Every item page's Install tab has this command pre-filled for that item, with the package manager of your choice (npm, pnpm, yarn, or bun).

## Referencing items by name

To use `add <name>` instead of the full URL, add this registry to the consuming project's `components.json`:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@design-system-ui": "https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```

```bash
bunx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

See [Registry](/docs/registry) for how items are built and served.
